<title>MEXICO: Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday that around 400 head were exported into the United States at one crossing point Monday.</p>
<p>Through Del Rio, Texas, around 400 head were sold, although not enough to establish trned or quote prices.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
